# Build intermediates. These are 13 MB across 178 files and every one of them
# changes on every build, so tracking them meant a release commit carried more
# churn in things nobody reads than in the source that produced them.
#
# watchlauncher.apk itself is NOT ignored: it is the artifact install-launcher.sh
# pins a checksum against, and having it in the tree is how you check that the
# published one is the one this source builds.
build/
